  "body": "Auction: on site on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 5:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nImagine waking up every day to the gentle rhythm of coastal life in one of Orewa’s most desirable streets. From the moment you arrive at 49 Settlers Grove, a genuine sense of warmth and belonging welcomes you home. This single-level sanctuary has been truly loved, offering an immediate feeling of comfort and ease that invites you to kick off your shoes, relax, and stay awhile.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home lies a light-filled open-plan lounge and dining domain, anchored by a good-sized kitchen complete with plenty of storage space. The open plan living flows seamlessly out onto the deck, taking in fantastic views over the Orewa Estuary. It is the ultimate backdrop for coastal living - whether you’re enjoying your morning coffee as the estuary wakes up or firing up the evening barbecue with friends in the golden afternoon light. For quiet evenings or versatile family living, a second living area provides the perfect retreat for movie nights or reading in peace.\r\n\r\nThe home offers four bedrooms, including a master suite with its own private ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Practicality is woven into every detail, starting with a double garage that houses a separate laundry, an extra WC, and a versatile extra room - ideal as a home office, hobby studio, or teenage hangout. Storage is abundant throughout, including convenient attic space to keep life clutter-free, while the fully fenced section ensures children and pets can play safely outdoors.\r\n\r\nBeyond your garden gate, the Orewa lifestyle is right at your fingertips. With private access leading directly onto the Te Ara Tahuna Estuary Cycleway and Walkway, you can easily grab your bike or launch your kayak onto the water anytime you choose. A leisurely walk takes you straight into town for your morning coffee, boutique shopping, and heading down to popular Orewa Beach for a refreshing swim. Excellent schooling options are also guaranteed, with the property sitting securely in-zone for both Orewa Primary School and Orewa College.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a property; it is a cherished lifestyle opportunity that may just tick every box on your wishlist. Properties offering this level of single-level comfort, fantastic estuary views, and direct trail access in Settlers Grove rarely come to market, making this a coastal haven you simply do not want to miss.",
